-- `markup_type_in_foreign` (checker-v2.md §25.2, boundary.md §9.3): the
-- platform `views` layers on `node` and declares a `foreign` whose type
-- mentions the markup type `Html.Html`. Its sibling would read one
-- lowering's representation of markup, and `views` names no lowering of its
-- own, so under whichever lowering the build selects the value could be
-- another's: refused at the declaration, `platform/Render.beni` 4:13.
import Node exposing (Program)


main : Program
main = Node.print "hello"
